{"id":"24.02.MyLittleNoireKitten","contentHtml":"<p>The project was created as part of the <code>Global Game Jam</code> hackathon. Based on the mechanics of classic flash games \"do it secretly\", we created a humorous arcade game about a prankster cat.</p>\n<p>I acted as the <mark>sole programmer and team leader</mark>, responsible for 100% of technical implementation and production process management.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Challenge</h2>\n<p>At the 48-hour Global Game Jam (theme \"Make me laugh\"), I <strong>led a team of two unfamiliar artists with one goal: to create a completed game that is guaranteed to cause laughter</strong>. The main challenge was to find that very \"wow feature\" and build the entire production pipeline around it.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Engineering Solution</h2>\n<p>To achieve this goal, I focused on three key areas: designing the \"wow effect\", ultra-fast implementation of core mechanics, and effective team management.</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>\"Wow Effect\" Engineering:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>The central element that caused laughter was the <mark>animation-sound transformation</mark>: at the push of a button, a cute cat jumped onto the toilet and turned into a smoking monster.</li>\n<li>For maximum comic effect, I added absurd details: the toilet began to shake to the <strong>sound of a working jackhammer</strong>, which I personally processed. This effect, supported by <code>VFX</code>, became the core of the entire gaming experience.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Rapid Prototyping and Pipeline:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><mark>In 48 hours, implemented all key mechanics from scratch</mark>: <code>NPC</code> \"vision\" system, progress bar filling logic, and win/loss conditions.</li>\n<li>For maximum speed, used <code>Zenject</code> for basic architecture and <code>DOTween</code> for fast and \"juicy\" animations.</li>\n<li>Under strict time constraints, I built an effective pipeline for working with artists, which allowed quickly integrating art and getting a fully playable prototype by the finale.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Development and Publication:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>After the hackathon, I independently improved the project, adding new levels, characters, and gameplay mechanics (buffs/debuffs).</li>\n<li>As a result, I <mark>published the game on the <code>Yandex Games</code> platform</mark>, fully integrating the <code>SDK</code> (<code>GamePush</code>).</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2>Outcome</h2>\n<p>A focused approach and precise implementation of the key idea brought the project unconditional success at the hackathon.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Goal Achieved:</strong> At the final demonstration, the \"wow effect\" worked perfectly, causing an explosion of laughter from the audience.</li>\n<li><strong>Hackathon Victory:</strong> The game took <strong>two nominations from partner studios: <code>\"Best Completed Game\"</code> and <code>\"Best Graphics\"</code></strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Successful Publication:</strong> The project was improved and published on the <code>Yandex Games</code> platform, where it found its audience.</li>\n<li><strong>Leadership Demonstration:</strong> This case proved my skills in rapid prototyping, managing a creative team under stressful conditions, and the ability to bring a product from idea to release.</li>\n</ul>\n","published":true,"title":"My Little Noire Kitten","date":"2024-02","type":"project","tagsArray":["Casual","PC","Web","Unity","C#","GamePush","Zenject (Extenject)","VFX","UniTask","Hackathon","DOTween","Audacity"],"heroVideo":["E9zH0mz-vnQ"],"shortDescription":"<p><strong>Led the team</strong> at Global Game Jam and steered it to victory. Focused the process on a single <mark>“wow factor”</mark> that entertained the audience.</p>\n","storeLinks":["https://globalgamejam.org/games/2024/little-noire-kitten-2"],"role":"jam","projectIcon":"/images/projects/24.02.MyLittleNoireKitten/icon.webp","cardBackground":"/images/projects/24.02.MyLittleNoireKitten/card.mp4?v=1765046930726","screenshots":[{"src":"/images/projects/24.02.MyLittleNoireKitten/screenshots/1.webp","width":1280,"height":720},{"src":"/images/projects/24.02.MyLittleNoireKitten/screenshots/2.webp","width":1280,"height":720},{"src":"/images/projects/24.02.MyLittleNoireKitten/screenshots/3.webp","width":1280,"height":720},{"src":"/images/projects/24.02.MyLittleNoireKitten/screenshots/4.webp","width":1280,"height":720}]}